#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:3
#: fd325ab56f214617b53a879a980b0c64
msgid "剪切矩阵应变（Shear Matrix Strain）"
msgstr "Shear Matrix Strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:5
#: b535401b734847b9aef7235430de8277
msgid "`Group`: `Lattice` | `Class`: `ShearMatrixCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:7
#: 66c63170745f4c4990a35ae81dfec7c5
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:9
#: 8334b8b9d9054777be84bd55ca2dc107
msgid "通过 xy/yz/xz 剪切矩阵分量生成非对角形变样本。对晶格矢量的三个剪切通道做系统扫描，每个通道独立控制 min/max/step。"
msgstr ""
"Generate off-diagonal deformations by scanning xy, yz, and xz shear-matrix "
"components, each with an independent minimum, maximum, and step."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:11
#: a45142fd537045bcb2fd7afad362f4bf
msgid ""
"\\gamma_{xy}=\\frac{s_{xy}}{100},\\quad "
"\\mathbf{S}=\\begin{bmatrix}1&\\gamma_{xy}&\\gamma_{xz}\\\\0&1&\\gamma_{yz}\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad"
" \\mathbf{C}'=\\mathbf{C}\\mathbf{S}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:13
#: 83fbc621f35d49f8bdd42c8481c89e3c
msgid "`symmetric=true` 时填充 S 的下三角对应项，使剪切路径更接近对称形变。"
msgstr ""
"With `symmetric=true`, matching lower-triangular entries are filled to form "
"a symmetric strain-like path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:15
#: 09fedff555ad4d2db0860353996516b5
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:17
#: 5c325f86934d43ad81a01aeccb4d2529
msgid "场景：模型预测剪切模量 C44 比 DFT 低 40%"
msgstr "Scenario: Predicted C44 is 40% below DFT"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:19
#: a2df45dfe05449a7813f83e281e9e617
msgid ""
"你在 fcc Al 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，C11/C12 都对，但 C44 只有 DFT 值的 60%。诊断发现：C44 是对应于 "
"xy/yz/xz 方向剪切的分量，而训练集里所有结构都是轴向拉伸/压缩（通过 `Lattice Strain` 生成的），模型没见过非对角剪切变形。"
msgstr ""
"An fcc Al NEP reproduces C11 and C12 but predicts only 60% of the DFT C44. "
"Its training set contains axial strains but no off-diagonal shear states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:21
#: 713e14d369f64407b0cfc48e1ab6c4a4
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 剪切弹性常数来源于非对角应变。如果训练集只覆盖对角应变（axial "
"strain），模型对剪切方向的刚度完全靠外推。需要往训练集里加入已知剪切分量的结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Shear elastic constants derive from off-diagonal strain "
"response. Add cells with controlled shear components so that response is "
"interpolated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:23
#: bd12cdb724d34754a068765774149b51
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 fcc Al 单胞"
msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed fcc Al cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:25
#: df4c58b03f524e138ccc08e654cc19ea
msgid "**目标：** 沿 xy 方向做 -3% 到 +3% 剪切，步长 1%，对称模式，共 7 个结构"
msgstr "**Objective:** Scan symmetric xy shear from -3% to +3% in 1% steps."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:27
#: 744ce74c26494e50adb4295af0afe5c6
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:28
#: c3d908b3ef0944efa4b3697e240b24ab
msgid "`xy_range` = `[-3, 3, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:29
#: 8429775f40714defbb76cf85e6fe2b5e
msgid "`yz_range` = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 yz）—— 注意要把步长非零的值写进去，否则 range 为空不生成"
msgstr "`yz_range` = `[0,0,1]` (one zero point; the step must be nonzero)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:30
#: d0749a8d2de14ee08243908b02aff727
msgid "`xz_range` = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 xz）"
msgstr "`xz_range` = `[0,0,1]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:31
#: eee54a5a92e34d0b92fdfed2ea10b848
msgid "`symmetric` = `true`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:33
#: 84c7c7d1c9c04fd4ae4f98e88311436c
msgid "**输出：** 7 个结构，剪切矩阵的 xy 分量从 -0.03 到 +0.03，yz 和 xz 分量为 0"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Seven structures with xy from -0.03 to +0.03 and zero yz/xz "
"components."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:35
#: 5277a45352314cb2901a390ebec9b64d
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:36
#: 9c5dd83a63dd4f2aabfc527243b9b71b
msgid "重训后重新计算弹性常数矩阵，C44 应该更接近 DFT 参考值"
msgstr ""
"After labeling and retraining, recompute the elastic tensor; C44 should "
"approach the DFT reference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:37
#: 123c00f261124c29bac17eea1960d879
msgid "检查输出结构的晶格角变化：单斜/triclinic 体系剪切后角度会偏离正交，确认变化在物理合理范围"
msgstr ""
"Inspect resulting cell angles and confirm that nonorthogonality remains in "
"the intended range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:38
#: ff9e306ee429464c90187504f42d92cf
msgid "如果 C44 改善但 C55/C66 仍有偏差，再单独扫 yz_range 和 xz_range"
msgstr "If C44 improves but C55/C66 do not, scan yz and xz separately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:39
#: 6d37212442064ca0b951ed068a496ee5
msgid "如果三个分量都需要同时补，再同时放开三个 range —— 但注意输出数 = Nxy * Nyz * Nxz，组合数很快爆炸"
msgstr ""
"Open all three ranges only when joint coverage is needed; output is Nxy × "
"Nyz × Nxz."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:41
#: db6753f54bc8479abf65d8bc9cc2da23
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:43
#: cb6f9bd078bf46dcaa39311f46161c88
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:44
#: eca3363082d841768aad2ce857281f2b
msgid "模型剪切模量、非对角弹性常数系统性偏差"
msgstr "Shear modulus or off-diagonal elastic response is systematically wrong"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:45
#: a106ee344a4f470295165bb80ec63491
msgid "训练集缺少非正交晶格构型、所有结构都在高对称格点"
msgstr "Training lacks nonorthogonal cells"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:46
#: d412136c8ff043a6858a0a67c8b0a370
msgid "需要覆盖剪切方向的应力-应变响应"
msgstr "Stress-strain response along shear directions is needed"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:48
#: 8702d90b72494bd7b6f53b20afc83a89
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:49
#: 633b91a19b9a4944b5372c8c4700a4f8
msgid "只需要体积和单轴应变 → `Lattice Strain` 更直接"
msgstr "Only volume and axial strain are needed; use `Lattice Strain`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:50
#: e1b6dac8187f416f9104a5a7fb0eb784
msgid "想通过角度而非矩阵分量控制剪切 → `Shear Angle Strain` 更适合"
msgstr ""
"Shear should be controlled through crystallographic angles; use `Shear Angle"
" Strain`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:51
#: ce356b650c874a6f89a09195cc47bc43
msgid "体系本身是刚性分子晶体，剪切只会破坏分子内拓扑 → 考虑 `identify_organic`"
msgstr ""
"The system is molecular and shear would distort intramolecular topology "
"without molecular protection"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:53
#: f0c5c7147cee41ed85b767def8518025
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:55
#: b6227a7c3aeb4989bdd0e50592903325
msgid "XY Range（xy_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:57
#: 22345b7543594a3fa11834cee30654cc
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。剪切矩阵 xy 分量的扫描区间，格式 `[min,"
" max, step]`，单位 %。比如 `sxy=5` 对应剪切矩阵分量 0.05。如果你只扫一个分量，把另外两个设为一个点就行——但注意不能设成 "
"`[0, 0, 0]`（步长为 0 会让 range 变空），正确写法是 `[0, 0, 1]` 保证至少生成一个 0 点。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(-5.0,5.0,1.0)`. xy scan as "
"`[min,max,step]` in percent; `5` means matrix component 0.05. Use `[0,0,1]` "
"for an inactive channel."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:59
#: e630c8982e474a2cbfb7ee739113901d
msgid "YZ Range（yz_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:61
#: 51afd086246c4aceb04cf6ff4175bcdc
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。yz 分量的扫描区间，单位和语法同 "
"xy_range。同理，不扫时写 `[0, 0, 1]`。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float,float,float]`, default `(-5.0,5.0,1.0)`. yz scan with the same "
"syntax; use `[0,0,1]` when inactive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:63
#: 1c9b11f19c3e40e989b17e69a8306e55
msgid "XZ Range（xz_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:65
#: 2d55489925904bb6ae311220cd9044eb
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(-5.0, 5.0, 1.0)`。xz 分量的扫描区间，同上。不扫时写 `[0, "
"0, 1]`。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float,float,float]`, default `(-5.0,5.0,1.0)`. xz scan with the same "
"syntax; use `[0,0,1]` when inactive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:67
#: 35f35f948b204b0aad281f1d08b4b2cb
msgid "输出总数 = Nxy * Nyz * Nxz。三个通道同时按默认值跑 = 11^3 = 1331 个结构。建议先单通道试跑验证参数，再逐步加通道。"
msgstr ""
"Output is Nxy × Nyz × Nxz. Three default 11-point channels produce 1,331 "
"structures. Validate one channel first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:69
#: 29c75a93114848318b9ed5c9d9e74b18
msgid "Symmetric（symmetric）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:71
#: bce59586accd4f15bcb8d4c0a2e229a9
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后剪切矩阵下三角同步填充（比如 `S[1,0] = "
"S[0,1]`），形变路径更接近物理上的对称剪切。如果你在研究非对称畸变（比如某些铁弹相变），把这个关掉。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. Mirror upper-triangular components into the lower "
"triangle, for example `S[1,0]=S[0,1]`. Disable only for an intentionally "
"asymmetric deformation path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:73
#: d8bb2c160c4e46abb335360a47785ce8
msgid "Identify Organic（identify_organic）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:75
#: 37c54fa736af49a1874b4b5dd89f8d53
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。分子晶体必须打开——否则剪切变形会撕裂分子内键。纯无机体系关着即可。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable molecular protection for molecular crystals;"
" leave disabled for purely inorganic systems."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:77
#: 7443a784a2ee48b4a77868afc65932b8
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:79
#: 7383019914d7498dbcd58157e41ae7fd
msgid "单分量弹性补样（仅 xy，±3%，对称）"
msgstr "Single-component elastic sampling (xy only, ±3%, symmetric)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:80
#: eeb19f041d1a44c9854afd48fd2dd6c2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ShearMatrixCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"xy_range\": [-3, 3, 1],\n"
"  \"yz_range\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"  \"xz_range\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"  \"symmetric\": true,\n"
"  \"identify_organic\": false\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:92
#: 9161ad5f5a7a4369ae9cf9fa97246c42
msgid "双分量剪切覆盖（xy+yz，±5%，对称，~121 个输出）"
msgstr "Two-component shear coverage (xy and yz, ±5%, symmetric, about 121 outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:93
#: 7f8af607dc76411ab9410143bd407c55
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ShearMatrixCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"xy_range\": [-5, 5, 1],\n"
"  \"yz_range\": [-5, 5, 1],\n"
"  \"xz_range\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"  \"symmetric\": true,\n"
"  \"identify_organic\": false\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:105
#: 0254e167b88d4b7d9ac2d009025b145c
msgid "三通道研究级（xy+yz+xz，±6%，步长 2%，非对称，~343 个输出）"
msgstr "Three-channel study (±6%, step 2%, asymmetric, about 343 outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:106
#: 368fe2fec4614a7a8b57ec4a1737d7e5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ShearMatrixCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"xy_range\": [-6, 6, 2],\n"
"  \"yz_range\": [-6, 6, 2],\n"
"  \"xz_range\": [-6, 6, 2],\n"
"  \"symmetric\": false,\n"
"  \"identify_organic\": false\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:118
#: 2c0705dac03543b0a4dc4f5125a9aba4
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:120
#: 4e2c724f9a044ae9a103c2e044efb6d2
msgid "`Lattice Strain` → `Shear Matrix Strain`：先补轴向应变，再补剪切分量，覆盖完整弹性张量"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` -> `Shear Matrix Strain`: cover axial response before shear"
" tensor components"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:121
#: 05e1e3ff2db742cba9ddbc34c6d99034
msgid "`Shear Matrix Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`：剪切变形后加坐标噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Shear Matrix Strain` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add coordinate noise after a "
"shear deformation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:122
#: 769abc89c177474abd7d7a1b2c370863
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Shear Matrix Strain`：先扩胞再剪切，适合研究大尺度剪切响应"
msgstr "`Super Cell` -> `Shear Matrix Strain`: shear at the intended cell scale"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:124
#: e6f6281e6a5341e2b5c674e95b358158
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:126
#: 3a681acb5f194402a91d5f9132cfd7a0
msgid ""
"**输出为空。** 检查 range 的步长是否 > 0。如果不扫某个分量，不能设置 `[0, 0, 0]` —— 步长为 0 会导致 range "
"为空。应该设置 `[0, 0, 1]` 确保至少生成一个点（0）。"
msgstr ""
"**No output.** Every step must be positive; use `[0,0,1]` for an inactive "
"component."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:128
#: 1bf181bad5f04950b740f0f53dc0cbfa
msgid ""
"**输出数量爆炸。** 三通道联扫的输出数 = Nxy * Nyz * Nxz。默认 `[-5, 5, 1]` 三个通道同时开 = 11^3 = "
"1331 个结构。建议先单通道试跑验证参数合理性后再加通道。"
msgstr ""
"**Output explodes.** Three channels form a Cartesian product. Validate one "
"channel and estimate the total before adding more."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:130
#: 13fb524f1e924f8b8b5e54ea0766767c
msgid "**剪切后结构物理不合理。** 剪切幅度过大导致晶格条件数恶化（接近奇异）。抽查最近邻距离和晶格行列式。±5% 以上建议逐步增加并每步检查。"
msgstr ""
"**Geometry becomes implausible.** Excessive shear can make the lattice ill-"
"conditioned. Inspect nearest-neighbor distances and the cell determinant, "
"increasing beyond ±5% gradually."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:132
#: 8856e05e39c74e03a6ac7940c7dac39f
msgid ""
"**vs Shear Angle Strain 如何选择。** Shear Matrix "
"在笛卡尔坐标下直接修改剪切矩阵分量，适合和弹性常数计算对齐；Shear Angle 修改晶胞角度 alpha/beta/gamma，适合和 "
"XRD/晶体学角度对齐。两者产生不同的形变路径，可以互补使用。"
msgstr ""
"**Matrix or angle shear?** Matrix shear directly controls Cartesian off-"
"diagonal components and aligns with elastic-tensor calculations. Angle shear"
" controls alpha, beta, and gamma and aligns with crystallographic "
"descriptions. They are distinct paths and may be complementary."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:134
#: 884b832a43844d328118629b04ed76e6
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:136
#: d71771f1775a495995d425fa3c39413e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Shr(xy={sxy}%,yz={syz}%,xz={sxz}%,sym={0|1})`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:138
#: c27f9c18b37143d980e77e413a17e99a
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-matrix-card.md:140
#: 320fec7c46424e3f9a8c92d1274d299b
msgid "无随机性。同参数同输入 → 严格一致输出。所有剪切分量按固定网格扫描。"
msgstr "Deterministic: all components are scanned on a fixed grid."
